  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Toronto Centre is a global centre of finacial crises management. The target group of this programme is senior level financial regulators and supervisors of partner developing countries. The goal is to contribute to financial stability, both in partner countries and worldwide. This, in turn, is expected to facilitate growth and poverty reduction. /dkelleci 2009.11.09</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Toronto Centre &#xE4;r ett global centrum f&#xF6;r finansiell krishantering. Denna programs m&#xE5;lgrupp &#xE4;r finansiella beslutsfattare och handl&#xE4;ggare i utvalda utvecklingsl&#xE4;nder. M&#xE5;let &#xE4;r att bidra till finansiell stabilitet, b&#xE5;de i utvecklingsl&#xE4;nder och globalt. Detta f&#xF6;rv&#xE4;ntas, i sin tur, bidra till tillv&#xE4;xt och fattigdomsminskning. /dkelleci 2009.11.09</narrative>
  </description>
